---
description: Before any Keyline visual, sprite, map-pin, facade, UI-chrome, or generated-art change, read docs/ART_DIRECTION.md and follow it. The direction is proposed and not yet approved.
alwaysApply: true
---

If this task changes how Keyline looks (sprites, map pins, facades, UI chrome, motion, or generated art), read `docs/ART_DIRECTION.md` in full before editing and follow it. `docs/visual-direction.md` does not override that guide. The direction is proposed; do not treat it as approved by Ryan.

Tasks that do not change appearance — logic, trivia, wallet, tests, copy that is not on a painted surface — are not bound by the palette, pixel, or silhouette rules in that guide.
